<title>USA: Lydall sees 1997 EPS fractionally higher.</title>
<headline>Lydall sees 1997 EPS fractionally higher.</headline>
<dateline>MANCHESTER, Conn. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lydall Inc said Wednesday that it is projecting earnings for 1997 to be around $1.38 a share on revenues of around $260 million.</p>
<p>Lydall earned $1.37 a share on revenues of $252.7 million in 1996.</p>
</text>
